  "details": "Since build 1491 update, the right stick up/down does not work correctly on the PCVR Quest controller. The right stick left and right do not respond in the gimmick that receives the controls on the world side. In addition, when the left stick is operated left or right, the right stick input responds simultaneously.\n\nThis problem can be seen in flight world using saccflight.(ex. https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_e4908cea-023b-4749-9ad7-a898b12996e7)\n\nI asked a friend and he did not have the problem with the vive controller.",
